title: Hollow_Recruitment
---
===
Hollow_Intro
===

Hollow: You feel it too, don't you? The Rust. Calling. Hungry.
Hollow: I was like you once. Pure. Hopeful. Then the Signal broke me open and the Rust poured in.

-> You survived the corruption. That's rare.
    === Hollow_Survival ===
-> The Rust doesn't control me. It won't control you either.
    === Hollow_Hope ===
-> I've seen what the Rust does. How are you still standing?
    === Hollow_Curious ===

===
Hollow_Survival
===

Hollow: Survived? No, Walker. I *accepted*. The Rust isn't a disease — it's evolution.
Hollow: The Purified burn it. The Rooted grow it. But I *became* it.

<<set $hollow_loyalty = $hollow_loyalty + 10>>

-> I need someone who understands the corruption. Join me.
    === Hollow_Accepted ===

===
Hollow_Hope
===

Hollow: ...you sound like I used to.
Hollow: The Rust always wins, Walker. But if you're walking into the heart of it, I want to see how far you get before it takes you too.

<<set $hollow_loyalty = $hollow_loyalty + 15>>

-> Then walk with me. I'll prove the Rust can be beaten.
    === Hollow_Accepted ===

===
Hollow_Curious
===

Hollow: I stopped fighting. The Rust is not an enemy — it's a symbiote. It amplifies what's already there.
Hollow: My anger became strength. My fear became armor.

<<set $hollow_loyalty = $hollow_loyalty + 10>>

-> I want to understand. Show me.
    === Hollow_Accepted ===

===
Hollow_Accepted
===

Hollow: You're either the bravest Walker I've met... or the most foolish.
Hollow: Maybe both. Let's find out which.

<<set $hollow_loyalty = 25>>
<<set $hollow_recruited = true>>
<<set $active_companions += 1>>
<<set $party: "Hollow" = true>>
<<set $quest_hollow_forgiveness = "active">>

Hollow <<companion_join>>
<<give_item vine_lash>>

-> Together, we'll find a cure.
    === Hollow_Joined ===

===
Hollow_Joined
===

Hollow: A cure... or acceptance. We'll see which comes first. <<signal>>
    -> Let's go. (End)
